# Vercel publishes every file in this repo as a public static asset at its own
# URL, regardless of whether the GitHub repo itself is private. This list keeps
# the live domain limited to what's actually meant to be shown to the client.
# See README.md's "Show the client?" column and CLAUDE.md's Layout table for
# which files these are. GitHub still has everything — this only affects what
# is web-reachable on the deployed domain.

# Iozera-only. Never client-facing. See docs/INTERNAL-before-the-onsite.md.
docs/INTERNAL-before-the-onsite.md

# Strategy source material — not for the client, and critique-1/critique-2
# are candid about our own weaknesses.
research/

# Internal working docs, not part of the site.
CLAUDE.md
PRODUCT.md
README.md

# Not referenced by the deployed prototype (its images are embedded as base64
# data URIs) — UASHMC's own collateral, no reason to expose it at a public URL.
images/
